{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZBHSsa7hZuPyBnpCpAF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SQisKjzkKnq3c84o9aQSBw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> /home/summereunann/.claude/projects/-data/memory/neurico-host-local-llm-fallback.md <<'EOF'\n\nUpdate 2026-10-30 (temperature_calibration_gaps workspace, 12 runs × 6,204 cells × 4 samples, vLLM 0.32): GPU0 48 GB free at 13:17; an existing workspace venv's python can run a chunked holder within seconds while your own `uv add vllm` runs (~4 min with UV_CACHE_DIR local, `.uv_cache` then deletable).\n- The \"hand placeholders to vLLM via PyTorch's cache\" trick failed for large allocations here (14B bf16, 7B bf16): 512 MB cached blocks can't serve multi-GB KV/embedding allocations → OOM with GBs \"reserved but unallocated\"; `expandable_segments` didn't fix it. What worked: pop w+1 GB of placeholders into the cache at MemorySnapshot.measure, wrap `gw.Worker.initialize_from_config` to release the rest with the real empty_cache just before KV allocation (v0.32 uses vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_runner.py, so patching gpu_model_runner silently does nothing), then refill an activation margin. Use enforce_eager=True. Set gpu_memory_utilization=(w+0.3)/47.4 or the startup check can fail by 0.02 GB.\n- A second engine in one process sometimes dies with \"CUDA error: invalid argument\". Safest is one model per process: finishing worker spawns successor (TAKEOVER_PID=self), waits for its per-PID ready file, exits. A shared `takeover_ready` filename is ambiguous with several workers — I acted on the wrong worker's file.\n- Idle small slices beat big busy ones by >10×: 3B AWQ on a 5.5 GB slice of GPU3 did 6.2k cells in ~8 min vs 7B on 100%-util GPU0 ~45 min. Check GPU1/3 slices first.\n- `mv`/`ls` on logs can stall minutes under load (showed `-?????????`). Grepping big worker logs in a poll loop stalled my pipeline: grep only current small logs. Don't reuse a log glob matching old failed-run lines.\n- CUDA allocator OOM spam grew one log to 14 MB; a tight grab() retry loop writes thousands of lines.\n- TAKEOVER_PID=1 waits forever; use a nonexistent PID for \"no predecessor\".\n- Science: mpnet embeddings of word salad collapse together (semantic diversity falls above the coherence cliff, an artefact); the Qwen3-8B judge floors at ~3 on a 1–9 scale even for gibberish → use share ≥5. Mistral-7B AWQ (solidrust) scored only .27 on HumanEval while 0.72 on TriviaQA; not an import artefact.\n- analyze.py with 2,000 bootstraps × 12 models × many metrics takes ~10 min under load; run in background.\nEOF\nsed -i 's/^- \\[Neurico host: local LLM fallback\\](neurico-host-local-llm-fallback.md) — .*/- [Neurico host: local LLM fallback](neurico-host-local-llm-fallback.md) — no API keys; shared GPUs; vLLM slice settings; one-model-per-process hand-over; KV-time placeholder release; corrupted :8011 logprobs (validate); flock per output; timings; GLUE parquet URLs; pgrep self-match/' /home/summereunann/.claude/projects/-data/memory/MEMORY.md; grep -c \"\" /home/summereunann/.claude/projects/-data/memory/MEMORY.md","description":"Append session lessons to memory"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2713,"cache_read_input_tokens":295071,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2713},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2332c03a-08c0-4a8b-a3ed-e94c26a471d1","uuid":"a86ddb8b-b7de-44fb-919b-0599f81e30c7","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:03:58.983Z","request_id":"req_011CgZBHSVWXFbNr3eyz8in8","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01SQisKjzkKnq3c84o9aQSBw":{"command":"cat >> /home/summereunann/.claude/projects/-data/memory/neurico-